{"id": "De6Q3XutRaO", "title": "Video by dayzero.story", "description": "Season 2 • Episode 5/5\nIf you find a flash drive, never plug it in. Max had to. 💾\nUnder Shelter 6 was Core 6, the AI that runs all the others. Max brought the key to shut it down. Then the core woke up and thanked him.\nReal tip: never plug in a drive you found. Hackers leave them on purpose. One click and your computer is theirs.\nSomeone swapped that key. Someone who knew where it was hidden, and could draw.\nComment RAEGAN or NEVIL 👇\nNew here? Season 1 starts with Day 1 on my page.\n#dayzero #survival #animation #cybersecurity #plottwist\nWho swapped the key?", "channel": "dayzero.story", "uploader_id": "23973906610", "uploader": "Day Zero Stories", "timestamp": 1792916508, "like_count": 1135, "comment_count": 20, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1108494288777584a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.579, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO5wKWAxK8WXGxUm1TxBm7Z1QQffIqlJ6EI6qOV4qgFkFNNnh-tk_xKwW--keYmR4malKjydQYv4-6w_4YpAYog4p4Lqwl2cFbM8Xc.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdoVQwzixKO3183F2G3NgSR9WuasAwLKnHWqvspC0NfeW-PQpTuNmXXXFu72LfMuBnUF6oPE9qXtL8g3yl3q6192&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PKuutNU2FNUQ7kNvwFrTtXf&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=vayzEzw1qvTe2hiUsAqGtg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRLSNjaczmW0Pz2CNV-I3kRYVv8wCo7WTxSRwRZDrO_ew&oe=6AF43827", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 72.579, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=